{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Selah Duo 是專注聖經閱讀的 App，提供離線經文、雙譯本對照與個人筆記，適合需要安靜閱讀空間、每日查經及跨版本比較的讀者。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-133.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>離線雙譯本對照閱讀</h2>\n<p>Selah Duo 內建七種離線聖經版本，支援關鍵字及經文索引搜尋，並記住上次閱讀位置。用戶可並排比較兩個譯本，加入書籤、劃線和個人筆記，於 Collections 集中管理。另設閱讀計劃與本地提醒，可調整字體、切換深淺色及使用系統語音朗讀。iPhone 與 iPad 支援自適應單頁及雙頁排版，無廣告、無訂閱、無需帳戶。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-131-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-132-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-133-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-134-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1206x2622bb-135-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1177\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Selah Duo: Bible Reader</li><li>應用類別：Book</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/selah-duo-bible-reader/id6823473181?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.237779+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T06:38:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T12:37:23.340548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:33.843958+00:00","content_hash":"f998b25b45d00266cdbed85ed9089f61986685775f7df94ac09d4c56746e7cf9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}